"placed for symbols with the highest ``short_score`` values, where the "
"number of short positions held at any time in the "
":class:`pybroker.portfolio.Portfolio` is specified by "
":meth:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_max_short_positions`. When rotation"
" is enabled with :meth:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy.enable_rotation`, "
"``short_score`` drives short rotation and orders set during an "
":class:`pybroker.strategy.Execution` are ignored. Mutually exclusive with"
" ``score``."
msgstr ""

